#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32F3 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32F3 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (F301, F302, F303, F318, F328, F334, F358, F373, F378, F398)
